 * NOT guarded on the grade row, though everything inside already is: `gradeInputs`
 * is empty where there is no grade row, and `syncRootCause` returns early without
 * one. A TAX review has no grade at all - S-GRADE is AQS-owned and AD-020 filters
 * it out of that form - so wrapping this in `if (gradeRow)` would cost a line to
 * say what the guards below already say for themselves.
